Daśaratha addresses full assembly --- Daśaratha pleads thousand years and seeks rest --- Daśaratha names Rāma crown prince --- Kings rejoice and urge crowning --- Daśaratha feigns ignorance to test them --- Citizens praise Rāma virtues and victories with Saumitri --- Rāma questions citizens like father after welfare --- People worship gods and seek blue-lotus Rāma crowned
